# Release staging. The installer here was already ignored, but only
# incidentally, by the generic `*.exe` above -- so its SIBLING SBOM was matched
# by no rule at all and a careless `git add -A` would have committed a build
# artifact. Found during pub-readiness phase-1 and deliberately deferred to
# phase-5 to keep an irreversible phase's blast radius small (the phase-1
# commit staged explicit paths rather than -A). Ignoring the directory is the
# fix, rather than adding one more extension pattern that the next artifact
# type would again slip past.
/dist/

