# as the evidence for their claims; the blanket rule above meant those files were
# never committed, so eight citations in the F31/F32/F33 dispositions pointed at
# paths absent from the repository. A cited-but-absent capture is indistinguishable
# from a fabricated one to any later reviewer, which is precisely the failure mode
# this audit programme exists to catch. Found and corrected during F36.
!docs/audit/**/*.log

